          "text": "Témoignages: ESPERCE (31) 09.08.1998 T1 ESPERCE (31) 09.08.1998 T2",
          "text_sha256": "7e249e6e45a0e66a8c39c4f89f2afbe9ae99aec925a88aa7e15c84ce42488cb1"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
